    portraitAssetId: portrait_s05
    dossierAssetId: dossier_s05
    eventVideoAssetId: video_s05
  clues:
  - id: CL_S01_BEHAVIOR
    suspectId: S01
    slotIndex: 1
    title: Behavior
    body: This is an operating manual, or rather an instruction file. It records
      how the cleaning robot performs its work. But what does this have to do with
      the case?
    displayImageAssetId: clue_s01_behavior
    targetImageAssetId: clue_s01_behavior
    targetName: clue_s01_behavior
    physicalWidthMeters: 0.1
  - id: CL_S01_INFORMATION
    suspectId: S01
    slotIndex: 2
    title: Information
    body: Image clue supplied; written description pending.
    displayImageAssetId: clue_s01_information
    targetImageAssetId: clue_s01_information
    targetName: clue_s01_information
    physicalWidthMeters: 0.1
  - id: CL_S02_BEHAVIOR
    suspectId: S02
    slotIndex: 1
    title: Behavior
    body: This disc was difficult to repair, but you eventually succeeded. It records
      a shocking secret about a wrongful case from five years ago. A fatal oversight
      led the AI to make the wrong judgment, causing the deaths of dozens of people;
      some of them may have survived...
    displayImageAssetId: clue_s02_behavior
    targetImageAssetId: clue_s02_behavior
    targetName: clue_s02_behavior
    physicalWidthMeters: 0.1
  - id: CL_S02_INFORMATION
    suspectId: S02
    slotIndex: 2
    title: Information
    body: Image clue supplied; written description pending.
    displayImageAssetId: clue_s02_information
    targetImageAssetId: clue_s02_information
    targetName: clue_s02_information
    physicalWidthMeters: 0.1
  - id: CL_S03_BEHAVIOR
    suspectId: S03
    slotIndex: 1
    title: Behavior
    body: 'This is a medical record, or perhaps a learning record. It documents part
      of the AI''s learning process. Strange: even such a powerful AI needs to learn.
      What does it need to learn? Through this prop, I can see the truth.'
    displayImageAssetId: clue_s03_behavior
    targetImageAssetId: clue_s03_behavior
    targetName: clue_s03_behavior
    physicalWidthMeters: 0.1
  - id: CL_S03_INFORMATION
    suspectId: S03
    slotIndex: 2
    title: Information
    body: Since its creation, the AI has continued to improve and innovate. Yet its
      understanding and imitation of human nature have never been sufficient. To
      solve this, the AI sought help from the world's leading psychologist, trying
      to understand the human mind and make better choices and judgments.
    displayImageAssetId: clue_s03_information
    targetImageAssetId: clue_s03_information
    targetName: clue_s03_information
    physicalWidthMeters: 0.1
  - id: CL_S04_BEHAVIOR
    suspectId: S04
    slotIndex: 1
    title: Behavior
    body: This photograph appears to show the daughter of the toolbox owner. The
      back is marked with a birth date and a death date... five years ago.
    displayImageAssetId: clue_s04_behavior
    targetImageAssetId: clue_s04_behavior
    targetName: clue_s04_behavior
    physicalWidthMeters: 0.1
  - id: CL_S04_INFORMATION
    suspectId: S04
    slotIndex: 2
    title: Information
    body: Image clue supplied; written description pending.
    displayImageAssetId: clue_s04_information
    targetImageAssetId: clue_s04_information
    targetName: clue_s04_information
    physicalWidthMeters: 0.1
  - id: CL_S05_BEHAVIOR
    suspectId: S05
    slotIndex: 1
    title: Behavior
    body: This is a telephone recording. The voice sounds like the secretary. It
      appears that the secretary was also part of the opposition. Could the secretary
      be the real killer?
    displayImageAssetId: clue_s05_behavior
    targetImageAssetId: clue_s05_behavior
    targetName: clue_s05_behavior
    physicalWidthMeters: 0.1
  - id: CL_S05_INFORMATION
    suspectId: S05
    slotIndex: 2
    title: Information
    body: Image clue supplied; written description pending.
    displayImageAssetId: clue_s05_information
    targetImageAssetId: clue_s05_information
    targetName: clue_s05_information
    physicalWidthMeters: 0.1
  detective:
